NOTES_INTERNAL.md
PROJECT.md

# ---- Exploratory work not reported in the paper ----
# Combination variants were dropped from the manuscript, so the code and the
# result files behind them are no longer published. Superseded sweep and
# summary artefacts are kept locally only.
ensemble_blend.py
results/ensemble_blend_metrics.csv
results/champion_gamma45_seed_ensemble_metrics.csv
results/exhaustive_metrics_with_da.csv
results/gamma_sweep_summary_213.csv
results/eda_report.md

# ---- Manuscript and submission material ----
# This repository publishes the code and results only. The manuscript, the
# cover letter and the submission paperwork stay local.
SUBMISSION_CHECKLIST.md
paper/*.md
paper/*.tex
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.txt
